<ul><li>  {{:Deepwater Harpoon}}
</li></ul>

== Walkthrough ==

Somewhere in the Ocean of Tears there is an undead island (rough loc of -604.96, -7343.81).  The island is populated by a few greater skeletons, gargoyles who kill the skeletons, and four specters at the top.  This is where the female paladin named Sentry Xyrin is triggered to spawn by speaking to [[Styria Fearnon]].  Xyrin mentions that she was part of a [boat disaster] and that she is from the Temple of Marr in [[Freeport]].  She will ask you to get her a [[Potion of Marr]] from Serna Tasknon in the Temple of Marr in Freeport.  With the potion she will be able to regain her strength and take on the undead.  (You can also initiate this quest by first speaking to someone in the Temple of Marr, getting the potion, and from that point on learning of Sentry Xyrin's location and going to look for her, which is actually the way most people would discover the quest).   You don't have to get the bottle from the Temple of Marr.

Head to the Sister's Island in the Ocean of Tears and find the small hut to the right with Styria Fearnon and say "Where is Sentry Xyrin?".  Styria Fearnon will realize that Sentry Xyrin must have shipwrecked on a nearby island and ask you to find her.  This will trigger Sentry Xyrin to spawn on the East coast of the Undead Island on top of a small ridge.  Be aware that she will fight Gargoyles and Skeletons during her stay.  She is slightly higher level than the Gargoyles but two at the same time can likely slay her.  She does not cast root but she will heal herself.

Go to the undead island and hail to her.   Don't leave yet it's just beginning.  After getting the potion, she will feel invigorated and decide march up to the spectres on the island and sit there.  If you wait for a while, she will despawn and the {{:Deepwater Harpoon}} will be on the ground.  If you invis vs. undead, you can avoid the spectres.

